    ///   <para>owl:Class</para>
    ///   <para>The class of individuals representing causal particles.</para>
    ///   <para>A causal particle represents the most elementary entity in physics, being it a simple state of an elementary particle, called quantum in the EMMO, or a chain of causally connected quanta.</para>
