    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>emmo:Volt</para>
    /// </summary>
    /// <remarks>
    ///   <para>owl:Class</para>
    ///   <para>SI unit for electric potential difference.</para>
    ///   <para>The volt is the unit of electric potential difference—electric potential difference is also known as voltage. The size of 1 volt is officially defined as the potential difference between two points of a wire carrying a current of 1 ampere when the power dissipated in the wire is 1 watt.</para>
