    /// <remarks>
    ///   <para>owl:Class</para>
    ///   <para>Seems to have to be processed through mechanical deformation. So it takes part of a manufacturing process. It is a Manufactured Product and it can be a Commercial Product</para>
    ///   <para>In manufacturing, a workpiece is a single, delimited part of largely solid material that is processed in some form (e.g. stone ).</para>
    ///   <para>fili e polveri non sono compresi</para>
    ///   <para>It has a shape, so we conclude that it is solid</para>
