    /// <seealso href="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_e04884d9_eda6_487e_93d5_7722d7eda96b">https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_e04884d9_eda6_487e_93d5_7722d7eda96b</seealso>
